---
---

<section class="section" id="about">
	<div class="container about-grid">
		<div>
			<p class="label">About</p>
			<h2 class="text-h2 heading">Notes on the person writing this</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="copy">
			<p class="text-lead">
				I'm a software engineer working on backend, platform, and cloud-native
				systems — mostly Java services running on Kubernetes and OpenShift.
			</p>
			<p>
				Day to day that means REST APIs, container platforms, and the
				automation that keeps them running. Outside of that, I build small
				personal projects (a couple are across the way) and occasionally
				write about what I've been learning.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about-grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: var(--space-6);
	}

	.heading {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
		max-width: 20ch;
	}

	.copy {
		display: grid;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.copy .text-lead {
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	@media (min-width: 860px) {
		.about-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
		}
	}
</style>
